fication and higher-level communication via tasks and artifacts. This capability enables agents to plan and execute more complex, end-to-end software tasks, elevating all aspects of development, from building features, UI iteration, and fixing bugs to research and generating reports.","name":"Antigravity IDE","packageUrl":"https://antigravity.google/","privacyUrl":"https://policies.google.com/privacy","publisher":"Google","publisherSupportUrl":"https://antigravity.google/support","publisherUrl":"https://www.google.com/","purchaseUrl":"https://antigravity.google/pricing","releaseNotesUrl":"https://antigravity.google/changelog","tags":["code","coding","develop","development","editing","editor","programming"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"体验新一代 IDE 的升空之旅","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"文档","DocumentUrl":"https://antigravity.google/docs"}],"license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Google Antigravity 是一个自主智能开发平台，将集成开发环境（IDE）带入以代理为中心的新时代。Antigravity 使开发者能够以更高层次的、面向任务的方式在多个工作区中管理代理，同时在其核心保留了开发者熟悉的 AI IDE 体验。Antigravity 将代理提取到独立的界面中，并为其提供在编辑器、终端和浏览器中自主运行所需的工具，强调通过任务和产物实现验证以及更高层次的通信。这一能力使代理能够规划并执行更复杂、端到端的软件开发任务，全面提升开发的各个方面，从功能开发、UI 迭代、缺陷修复到研究和报告生成。","privacyUrl":"https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=zh-CN","tags":["代码","开发","编程","编辑","编辑器"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://antigravity.google/support","publisherUrl":"https://www.google.com/","releaseDate":"2026-11-11","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://antigravity.google/changelog","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"411ee5b30152224ab652f0629684a360adabd366","manifestVersion":"1.28.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/g/Google/AntigravityIDE/2.6.0/Google.AntigravityIDE.installer.yaml","sha256":"c9b5080a6c95a5fe635fa892437529302be7fa797fe7716e6a78276a4b7ea1a0"},{"path":"manifests/g/Google/AntigravityIDE/2.6.0/Google.AntigravityIDE.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"b4eda00511b9cfd89948439e7304d6a5750e80c739a004b16ce6afd2a9e53b41"},{"path":"manifests/g/Google/AntigravityIDE/2.6.0/